abstract: >-
  Exact-arithmetic companion for bounded Smith-profile, filtered-lattice and
  hostile mutation cross-checks associated with the manuscript Depth-Two
  Smith Profiles and Carry Geometry for Affine Hjelmslev--Radon Incidence.
  The software does not replace the written all-prime proofs and makes no
  novelty, priority or exhaustive-literature claim.
